    <td bgcolor="#FFFFFF">
	<div align=justify><font class="storytext"><P align=center><SPAN class=black24><FONT size=5><STRONG>The loos!</STRONG></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P><BR>
<TABLE cellSpacing=0 cellPadding=0 width="100%" border=0>
<TBODY>
<TR>
<TD align=middle><FONT size=5><STRONG><IMG height=260 alt="Closed shop ... Madonna not one to share" src="http://images.thesun.co.uk/picture/0,,2004470268,00.jpg" width=200></STRONG></FONT></TD></TR>
<TR>
<TD align=middle><STRONG><FONT size=1><SPAN class=blacktext>Closed shop ... Madonna not one to share</SPAN><BR></FONT></STRONG></TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE></P>
<P><STRONG>MADGE insisted no one else used the ladies’ toilet when she did.</STRONG></P>
<P>The Queen Of Pop’s minders even stood outside to ensure guests didn’t wander in and accidentally overhear the royal wee.</P>
<P>One desperate guest forced to queue said: “What on Earth did they think I was going to do to her?”</P>
<P><STRONG>Perhaps she wanted to make it a Kabba-loo...</STRONG></P>
<P align=center><SPAN class=black24><FONT size=5><STRONG>What they ate and drank</STRONG></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P><BR>
<TABLE cellSpacing=0 cellPadding=0 width="100%" border=0>
<TBODY>
<TR>
<TD align=middle><FONT size=5><STRONG><IMG height=260 alt="Water hoot ... Madge prefers special Kabbalah brand" src="http://images.thesun.co.uk/picture/0,,2004470272,00.jpg" width=200></STRONG></FONT></TD></TR>
<TR>
<TD align=middle><STRONG><FONT size=1><SPAN class=blacktext>Water hoot ... Madge prefers special Kabbalah brand</SPAN><BR></FONT></STRONG></TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE></P>
<P>GUESTS&nbsp;had a real food frenzy, but <STRONG>MADONNA</STRONG> obviously didn’t partake – she once told me she never eats anything when she goes to restaurants.</P>
<P><STRONG>And look at what she missed: oysters, tuna tartare, fillet steak with green peppercorn sauce, corn-fed roast chicken, veal Milanese, spaghetti Bolognese, Dover sole and cod.</STRONG></P>
<P><STRONG>Sweet treats included chocolate cake, apple tart, pavlova and ice cream.</STRONG></P>
<P>To wash all that down the guests could choose from <STRONG>Cipriani’s famous Bellini cocktails, Veuve Cliquot champagne and fine Italian wines.</STRONG></P>
<P><STRONG>MADONNA</STRONG> had her army of rabbis in tow who had all dressed down for the evening. And they all clearly had a very good time –&nbsp; they each handed the doormen very large tips at the end of the night. Who says Kabbalah's no fun? </P>
<P><STRONG><BR>source :<A href="http://www.thesun.co.uk/">THESUN</A></STRONG></P>
</font></div>
	</td>
  </tr>
